opencv
Version=5.0.0
Release=5

Synopsis:
Automatically enable CUDA only when the installed toolkit, current compiler,
and detected GPU pass a compile and runtime check. Test cuDNN separately before
enabling the CUDA DNN backend. Use a CPU build when CUDA is unavailable or
incompatible, and retry once without CUDA if the full CUDA build fails.
Do not install or change GCC or the CUDA toolkit. Regenerate the package file
list on the next build because optional CUDA changes the installed modules.

